&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Company Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ecosio is a fast-growing, innovative service company and a leading provider of B2B integration, specialising in electronic data interchange (EDI), Web EDI and e-invoicing. ecosio is part of Vertex, Inc., a leading global provider of indirect tax solutions listed on Nasdaq (VERX).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our brand slogan is&amp;nbsp;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Connections That Work&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;as we believe strong connections are central to successful business relationships - both external and internal. At ecosio, we hire individuals from all backgrounds and are committed to creating an inclusive work environment. We are technology lovers, set the highest standards for our solutions, and put innovative ideas first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Job Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll connect with the role if you enjoy...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting and developing our AWS cloud infrastructure (EC2, Docker, MongoDB, ElasticSearch, Redis)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the team on our primary goals: high availability, scalability, security and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing Kubernetes infrastructure and Linux-based EC2 instances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving complex technical problems with clean, sustainable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking over some tasks in security management and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our build management/deployment (GitLab, Maven, Docker)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking care of the development and optimisation of the CI/CD pipelines together with our developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our current tech stack in the Web Application Team is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure: Kubernetes, AWS, ArgoCD, Terraform, HAProxy, GitLab CI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data storage and querying: MongoDB, Redis, Elasticsearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and performance tools: Prometheus, Datadog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To connect with ecosio it is important to have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the field of computer science or engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of work experience in the software development of enterprise web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience with JavaScript/Typescript and popular frameworks like React (Angular or Vue are also acceptable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant work experience with Java 11+, Spring / Spring Boot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge in software design (e.g. design patterns)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good command of written and spoken technical English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And nice to have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A running or completed education in the field of computer science or engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with system monitoring platforms (e.g. Prometheus, Datadog)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By connecting with us you will experience...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our remote-first culture lets you work remotely from one of our designated countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit your schedule and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget to invest in conferences, courses, or career coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office allowance to create a workspace that fits your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular events and trips to connect, celebrate, and have fun with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workations of up to 90 days per year within the EU, combining travel and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing support, including mental health resources and employee assistance programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional country-specific benefits based on your location&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sounds like a connection that works? Then apply now and we will get in touch soon!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of our hiring process at ecosio, we conduct standard background checks. You can find more information about them by clicking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ecosio.com/en/background-check/&quot; data-cke-saved-href=&quot;https://ecosio.com/en/background-check/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to build Connections That Work by fostering a diverse and inclusive team. We are committed to making everyone feel valued and empowered to contribute their unique skills, experiences and perspectives. And now we want to connect with you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a driven technician (m/f/d) with proven hands-on experience in mechanical assembly, soldering, desoldering, wire harnesses, and troubleshooting mechanical and electronic tasks. In this role, you will support and maintain existing products to ensure they remain fully operational and improve and develop new solutions for robust hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires both technical excellence and the ability to adapt and make decisions under uncertainty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the robotics systems are ready to be used at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create detailed documentation, technical drawings, and assembly instructions for testing rigs or needed components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (mechanical, software, manufacturing) to ensure seamless system integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Bill of Materials (BOM), assembly instructions, and quality control documentation, support and creation of SOPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve mechanics and electronics issues during development and production phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with emerging technologies and best practices in robotics and mechanical/electronics design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform assembly and disassembly of robots components, cables, and PCBs and other devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out soldering, desoldering, wiring, and basic troubleshooting tasks (e.g. oscilloscope, signal analyzers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support procurement activities by identifying suitable products which meet requirements, sourcing suppliers, and obtaining quotations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to travel to China for business trips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role involves significant travel (approximately 50%) to client sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work autonomously on open-ended, evolving tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with soldering SMD components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Altium / Solidworks is recommended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English, Spoken and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electronics design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of actuators and sensors using robotics, familiarity with sensor integration (force/torque sensors, encoders, IMUs) is recommended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with rapid prototyping (3D printing, CNC machining, laser cutting) is recommended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to find fast solutions to common problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3-5 years of proven work experience in related fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in robotics, mechatronics, or automation industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in designing robust cabling solutions and cable harnesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with electronics design and PCB production stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of structural, thermal, and dynamic analysis to validate designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Profile&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathy and excellent communication skills to enable great teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with a passion for cutting-edge robotics technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a focus on robust system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable to fast-paced development cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firmware development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio, together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Mechatronics and Hardware Test Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;. Join our team in Munich, where you will design, implement, and validate mechatronic test scenarios for the development, certification, and quality assurance of our robotic systems, subsystems, and components. We are seeking an experienced and curious, hands-on generalist with a multidisciplinary background who thrives across mechanical, electrical, and software engineering domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Plan, design, and automate test setups and fixtures for robot prototypes, subassemblies, and components across the product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Run tests, analyze the test data, and report findings to the engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Root Cause Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate and diagnose product defects and quality issues to support corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with development, quality, and production teams, and represent testing in technical reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Create, standardize, and maintain test specifications, procedures, and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Methods:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and implement improvements to existing test methods to increase efficiency, coverage, and repeatability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support manufacturing and production teams in troubleshooting and resolving test-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in mechatronics, robotics, mechanical engineering, electrical engineering, or a related field, or an equivalent qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Verification:&lt;/strong&gt; At least three years of industry experience testing, verifying, and validating complex mechatronic or robotic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional experience writing Python for test automation, using Git-based version control such as GitLab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sensor Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience implementing and maintaining sensor applications, such as force and torque, position, or temperature sensors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial Interfaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience with Linux environments, including Bash scripting, and with industrial communication protocols and real-time bus systems such as OPC UA or EtherCAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with CAD for mechanical design, such as SolidWorks, or PCB layout tools, such as Altium, and practical workshop skills such as soldering, harness wiring, mechanical assembly, and prototyping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with certification and functional safety standards, such as ISO 10218, ISO 13849, or IEC 60204.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factory Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in industrial robotics or factory automation, including PLC programming and integration, for example with TwinCAT or Beckhoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-Time Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with C++ and MATLAB/Simulink for real-time applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with requirements and quality management tools such as Jama or SAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German Language:&lt;/strong&gt; German language proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving License:&lt;/strong&gt; Valid Class B driving license or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio, together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Flight Dynamics Engineer, you will work in a small team of dedicated engineers responsible for the Flight Dynamics and Mission Planning for Planet’s fleet of satellites. The Flight Dynamics disciplines of this team include mission design, orbit determination, maneuver design and execution (with propulsion and differential-drag), and conjunction assessment &amp;amp; mitigation. Mission Planning is concerned with optimal scheduling of imaging and contacts for Planet’s Dove, SkySat, Pelican, and Tanager constellations. This operations research problem has a direct impact on fulfilling the business needs for the world’s largest heterogeneous constellation of Earth Observation satellites. Your role will involve developing and automating tools to assess mission design trade-offs that will define the future of Planet&#39;s constellations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, design, and architect new software solutions for managing Mission Design needs for Planet&#39;s increasingly diverse fleets of satellites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on complex optimization problems with your knowledge of flight dynamics and software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and automate tools to assess mission design trade-offs that will define the future of Planet&#39;s constellations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with mission planning, flight dynamics, and ground software teams to improve the operations of existing fleets and enable future missions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform first-principles analysis to optimize scheduling of imaging and contacts for Planet&#39;s diverse satellite constellations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Aerospace Engineering, physics or related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in orbital mechanics and space mission operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge in software development, in C++ and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience carrying out first-principles analysis and operationalizing MVP solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal technical communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with constellation and mission design trade studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing one or more of the following:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orbit determination and high-fidelity propagation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Covariance realism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-thrust mission design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maneuver automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constellation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining peer-reviewed code, attention to quality including automated testing, and continuous integration and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€86.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
